<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND 306-4 AT CLOSE -- DAY 3, 1ST TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 306-4 AT CLOSE -- DAY 3, 1ST TEST.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 306 for four in reply to Zimbabwe's 376 at the close of the third day's play in the first test at Queen's Club on Friday.</p>
</text>
